From: lfdevs <lfdevs@lfdevs.com>
Date: Sun, 19 Jul 2026 02:16:33 +0800
Subject: backend-anland: add PipeWire audio bridge

Create persistent PipeWire sink and source nodes for desktop playback and Android microphone audio.

Negotiate the Anland 5.13 audio format, bound and validate datagrams, and keep microphone samples in a bounded ring buffer. Duplicate the transport socket for the audio thread so fallback and reconnect cannot race fd ownership.

Add an optional anland-pipewire build feature so display support remains available when PipeWire development files are absent.
